# The graphics change: a specification, the style file, the render script and the drawing program are hashed as read,
# staged from those bytes and compared with the owner's approved hashes, so their bytes must not depend on how a checkout
# converts line endings. Every other file keeps the repository's setting.
graphics/** text eol=lf
wave-*/item-*/graphics/*.json text eol=lf
config/graphics-style.json text eol=lf
